    {
      "_id": "pndjYc9HjEigBxc4",
      "name": "Mummy Rot",
      "type": "action",
      "img": "systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp",
      "effects": [],
      "folder": null,
      "sort": 500000,
      "flags": {
        "core": {}
      },
      "system": {
        "description": {
          "gm": "",
          "value": "<p>This disease and any damage from it can't be healed until this curse is removed. A creature killed by mummy rot turns to dust and can't be resurrected except by a 7th-level <em>@Compendium[pf2e.spells-srd.kqhPt9344UkcGVYO]{Resurrect}</em> ritual or similar magic.</p>\n<p><strong>Saving Throw</strong> @Check[type:fortitude|dc:25]</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Stage 1</strong> carrier with no ill effect (1 minute)</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 2</strong> [[/r 4d6[negative]]] damage and @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg]{Stupefied 1} (1 day)</p>"
        },
        "source": {
