      },
      "system": {
        "description": {
          "gm": "",
          "value": "<p>@Template[type:emanation|distance:30]{30 feet}&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<hr />\n<p>Living creatures are @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 1} whil in amummy guardian's despair aura.</p>\n<p>They can't naturally recover from this fear while in the area but recover instantl once they leave the area.</p>\n<p>When a creature first enters the area, it must succeed at a @Check[type:will|dc:25] save (after taking the penalty from being frightened) or be @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.6uEgoh53GbXuHpTF]{Paralyzed} for 1 round.</p>\n<p>The creature is then temporarily immune for 24 hours.&nbsp;</p>"
        },
